srt-slurm vendors the tachometer-scraper and tachometer-writer crates
(upstream commit 30a2bd935ea8e0cfa983c5cd4bc903d5d463f254, Apache-2.0,
authors "Tachometer Contributors"). niu-lai-viz is derived from those
copies under src/tachometer/ in srt-slurm.

Modifications (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
  crates/niu-lai-writer   renamed from tachometer-writer; adds
                          DatasetWriter::streaming (seal a segment every
                          save interval without an outbox).
  crates/niu-lai-viz      derived from tachometer-scraper; the DCGM,
                          node-exporter, backend and frontend filters and the
                          CPU aggregation were replaced by config-driven
                          relabeling rules (src/rules.rs); the CLI, config,
                          run layout (src/run.rs), HTTP server and UI are new.
  Modified source files carry a header noting the change.
